<%#
  Layout for the standalone public pages (PagesController: privacy, account-deletion, cards).

  Deliberately not the application layout and not the asset pipeline: these pages are linked from
  outside the app — the Play listing points at /privacy and /account-deletion, the app's Settings
  screen at /cards — so each has to render for a visitor with no account, no session and no
  JavaScript, in one request. Everything they need is inlined here.

  What it is *not* is three copies of the same CSS. Until this layout existed each page carried its
  own near-identical style block, and they had already drifted; the shared look now lives in one
  place and a page adds only what is genuinely its own via `content_for :styles`.

  Colours mirror the Flutter app's AppPalette (lib/app_palette.dart) so a player arriving from the
  app's Settings button stays in the same product: cream and ink with a deep-red accent in light,
  navy and bone with gold in dark. They are declared once as custom properties and re-declared in
  the dark media query, so a rule only ever names a role (--accent), never a hex.
%>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="all">
  <%# Tints the browser/OS chrome around the page to match whichever theme is showing. %>
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#F0EDE6" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#14171F" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)">
  <title><%= yield :title %> — Carnevale Companion</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      /* Tells the UA to render form controls, scrollbars and the like in the matching scheme. */
      color-scheme: light dark;

      --bg: #F0EDE6;         /* AppPalette.background */
      --surface: #F5F2EE;    /* AppPalette.paper — raised panels */
      --text: #2C2418;       /* AppPalette.ink */
      /* AppPalette.inkSubtle (#7A6E62) reads at only 4.1:1 on the cream background, and these pages
         use it for whole lines of body-sized text. Darkened just enough to clear WCAG AA (5.0:1). */
      --subtle: #6E6358;
      --accent: #8B1A1A;     /* AppPalette.red — the light-theme accent */
      --border: rgba(44, 36, 24, .16);
      --accent-tint: rgba(139, 26, 26, .07);
      --accent-edge: rgba(139, 26, 26, .28);
      --code-bg: rgba(44, 36, 24, .07);
    }

    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root {
        --bg: #14171F;       /* AppPalette.backgroundDark */
        --surface: #191D27;  /* AppPalette.surfaceDark */
        --text: #EDE8DF;     /* AppPalette.inkLight */
        --subtle: #AA9E92;   /* AppPalette.inkLightSubtle */
        --accent: #B1986C;   /* AppPalette.mutedGold — the dark-theme accent */
        --border: rgba(237, 232, 223, .14);
        --accent-tint: rgba(177, 152, 108, .10);
        --accent-edge: rgba(177, 152, 108, .38);
        --code-bg: rgba(237, 232, 223, .10);
      }
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.65;
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--bg);
    }
    .wrap { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem 1.25rem 5rem; }
    h1 { font-size: 2rem; margin: 0 0 .25rem; letter-spacing: .02em; }
    h2 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin: 2.25rem 0 .5rem; }
    .meta { color: var(--subtle); font-size: .9rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    a { color: var(--accent); }
    ul, ol { padding-left: 1.25rem; }
    li { margin: .3rem 0; }
    code {
      background: var(--code-bg);
      padding: .1rem .35rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: .9em;
    }
    .callout {
      background: var(--accent-tint);
      border: 1px solid var(--accent-edge);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      margin: 1.25rem 0;
    }
    footer {
      margin-top: 3rem;
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--subtle);
      font-size: .875rem;
    }
    <%= yield :styles %>
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="wrap">
    <%= yield %>

    <footer>
      Carnevale is a trademark of its respective owner. This companion app is an unofficial,
      fan-made tool and is not affiliated with or endorsed by the publisher of the game.
      <%= yield :footer_extra %>
    </footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
